":"nature","style":"hard-edge-faceted-nature","title":"Multi-stem Understory Shrub","description":"Hard-edge faceted S02 understory shrub with three independently grounded low stems, a continuous asymmetric broad crown and shallow frontal notch. Limited olive values follow coherent face orientation. Simplified supporting vegetation, 1.218 m high; no leaf or wind rig.","bounds":{"x":1.7,"y":0.97,"z":1.21776,"unit":"m"},"triangles":296,"materials":5,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-multistem-shrub-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":25068,"sha256":"874db44df60188dfcb8af1167fa83e6390e970c2aab5f3e377616f4350fb544a"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-multistem-shrub-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":697772,"sha256":"ea8e99545dd3db912162322da8125f7bde6a376c15cef8b7f7a70ec197fb5028"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-multistem-shrub-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":36463,"sha256":"6aba3dfe632ca7b8ac5ca8b2e8943a5de910a7a8fe97da38d1b8d62cf2f7d7c2"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-multistem-shrub-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":301112,"sha256":"f31d483571853d7a217855544a636434a8c08c4d43d8c2335791d239ce9342a0"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-core"},{"id":"nature-young-conifer-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"prop","theme":"nature","style":"hard-edge-faceted-nature","title":"Young Central-Leader Conifer","description":"Hard-edge faceted young conifer (style plan S02), a continuous tapered central leader with unequal branch whorls, compact overlapping short-edged canopy tiers with a re-centered middle crown and a slender apex. A simplified supporting environmental tree, not a high-detail hero asset. Cool evergreen values follow coherent surface orientation; low-contrast bark. Visual asset without wind rig.","bounds":{"x":1.67226,"y":1.44629,"z":3.81663,"unit":"m"},"triangles":638,"materials":5,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-young-conifer-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":50384,"sha256":"8bb2bb